  groups:
    count: 3-4 monochrome 4-connected path fragments, ordered left to right
    width: 2-3 columns each
    cells: 2-4 foreground cells per group; each forms a single connected component
    color: each group is monochrome (one non-bg color); colors may repeat across groups
    shape: path-like polyomino where every cell has degree 1 or 2; exactly 2 global endpoints
    endpoints: exactly 1 degree-1 cell on left edge column, exactly 1 on right edge column
